msgstr "ऐड नहीं चल पाया। कृपया फिर कोशिश करें।"

#. toast: WATCH AD tapped while the phone is offline (C7.2)
#. REVIEW C7.2
msgid "No internet: bonus videos come back when you are online."
msgstr "इंटरनेट नहीं है: ऑनलाइन होते ही बोनस वीडियो फिर मिलेंगे।"

#. toast: the reward of an ad that was on screen when the app closed, paid on the next launch; never ₹ (C7.2, C7.5)
#. REVIEW C7.2
